    <title>一些旧相片</title>
    <link href="/2026/07/26/%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E6%97%A7%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%87/"/>
    <url>/2026/07/26/%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%9B%E6%97%A7%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%87/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>旧时间给了我现在什么呢？<br>可能是对旧时代的怀念吧…</p><p>毕竟高中以前 我从来没出现过对小学的怀念<br>可是高中了 我居然开始怀念起了初中…<br>到底是他们的素质变了…<br>还是我的观念变了…</p><p><img src="/images/1785050668389.jpg" alt="月"><br><img src="/images/1785050668596.jpg" alt="湾边"><br><img src="/images/1785050668684.jpg" alt="天黑了"><br><img src="/images/1785050668763.jpg" alt="落日"><br><img src="/images/1785050668854.jpg" alt="还是落日"><br><img src="/images/1785050668915.jpg" alt="Forest"><br><img src="/images/1785050669036.jpg" alt="SKY &amp; MOON"><br><img src="/images/1785050669106.jpg" alt="哪个地方呢..."><br><img src="/images/1785050669169.jpg" alt="Universal"><br><img src="/images/1785050669265.jpg" alt="回家的路"><br><img src="/images/1785050669326.jpg" alt="Forgotten......"><br><img src="/images/mmexport1754560868156.jpg" alt="北京中央电视台"></p>]]></content>
    
    
    
